#. type: Title #
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:1 docs/ui/foundations.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Visual foundations"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:8
msgid ""
"Visual language for Portal UI. Token **values** are defined only in [`src/ui-"
"kit/styles/globals.css`](../../src/ui-kit/styles/globals.css). This page "
"defines **intent, usage, and dimension adaptation**. Stack: Tailwind CSS v4 "
"+ shadcn/ui (`@freeanima/ui-kit`). DaisyUI is **not** used."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:10
msgid ""
"Each section uses the [dimension adaptation template]"
"(dimensions.md#dimension-adaptation-template)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:12
msgid ""
"Agent bans (raw CSS vars, DaisyUI tokens) → [`.agent/rules/frontend-ui.md`]"
"(../../.agent/rules/frontend-ui.md)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Color and theme"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Intent:** Semantic surfaces and text, not ad-hoc hex. Dark mode via root `.dark`. Accent variants on dark via `data-color-theme` (`neutral` default, `ocean` / `forest` / `sunset` / `violet`) from local preference (`portal-sdk/color-theme`).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Usage:** Tailwind semantic classes (`bg-background`, `text-muted-foreground`, `bg-primary`, `border-border`, …). Prefer `@apply` with those utilities over raw `var(--background)` outside `globals.css`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Lens        | Adaptation                                                                                                                                 |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| Invariant   | Semantic token names; light/dark pairs; destructive for irreversible risk                                                                  |\n"
"| Layout      | N/A (same palette); chrome may use `sidebar-*` tokens                                                                                      |\n"
"| Interaction | Hover/active tints (`hover:bg-muted`, `bg-primary/20` selection) only when pointer can hover; touch must not rely on hover-only color cues |\n"
"| Shell       | Accent theme is **local client preference**, not Shell kind; do not ship a separate palette per shell                                      |\n"
"| Forbidden   | DaisyUI `data-theme` / `--color-base-*`; choosing colors from `getShellKind()`                                                             |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Pending alignment:** Feature-local one-off colors that bypass semantic tokens.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Typography"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Intent:** Clear hierarchy — page/panel title, body, secondary, meta/label.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Usage (current practice):** Panel titles often `text-lg font-semibold` or `text-sm font-semibold`; body `text-sm`; secondary/meta `text-xs text-muted-foreground`; truncate long titles with `truncate`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Lens        | Adaptation                                                                                    |\n"
"| ----------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Invariant   | Hierarchy roles (title / body / secondary / meta)                                             |\n"
"| Layout      | Compact may hide or shorten secondary lines; do not invent a second type scale per breakpoint |\n"
"| Interaction | Enlarge **hit targets** with spacing/min-height, not by breaking the type scale               |\n"
"| Shell       | N/A                                                                                           |\n"
"| Forbidden   | Different font stacks per shell                                                               |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Spacing and density"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Intent:** Consistent padding and control heights; touch-friendly targets without sparse pointer UIs.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Usage:** Control heights `h-8` / `h-9` / `h-10`; list rows often `min-h-11` + `px-1 py-1`; panel headers `p-3`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:56
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Lens        | Adaptation                                                                                                               |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| Invariant   | Spacing scale via Tailwind; shared row/control heights where possible                                                    |\n"
"| Layout      | Compact chrome must clear bottom nav (`--app-bottom-nav-h`); denser chrome, not denser unsafe hits                       |\n"
"| Interaction | **touch:** minimum ~44px hit target (`min-h-11`); **pointer:** may use denser icon buttons if hover/menu still reachable |\n"
"| Shell       | Safe-area insets via shell/host (`shared-safe-area.css`); not a second density system                                    |\n"
"| Forbidden   | `getShellKind()` to pick padding                                                                                         |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "Radius"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Intent:** Soft but consistent corners from `--radius` (and sm/md/lg/xl derivatives in `@theme`).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Usage:** Controls/menus often `rounded-md` / `rounded-sm`; rows/Dialogs `rounded-lg`; pills/switches `rounded-full`; compact sheets may use larger top radius (`rounded-t-2xl`).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:70
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Lens        | Adaptation                                                                     |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| Invariant   | Radius tokens; map control vs surface roles                                    |\n"
"| Layout      | Sheet/drawer presentation may use larger top radius; Dialog stays `rounded-lg` |\n"
"| Interaction | N/A                                                                            |\n"
"| Shell       | N/A                                                                            |\n"
"| Forbidden   | One-off `rounded-[13px]` sprawl (**pending alignment** where present)          |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "Border and dividers"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Intent:** Separate regions with `border-border`; prefer list separators or muted backgrounds over card-in-card stacks.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:82
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Lens        | Adaptation                                                                           |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| Invariant   | `border-border` / `border-input` for controls                                        |\n"
"| Layout      | Expanded multi-column uses column borders; compact drawers use edge borders + shadow |\n"
"| Interaction | N/A                                                                                  |\n"
"| Shell       | N/A                                                                                  |\n"
"| Forbidden   | Decorative multi-border chrome without information structure                         |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "Shadow and elevation"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Intent:** Elevation signals overlay/stacking, not decoration.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Usage:** Controls `shadow-xs`; overlays/drawers `shadow-lg` sparingly.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:96
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Lens        | Adaptation                                                |\n"
"| ----------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Invariant   | Prefer semantic elevation steps; avoid stacked glow       |\n"
"| Layout      | Drawer/Sheet/Dialog use elevation; list rows usually flat |\n"
"| Interaction | N/A                                                       |\n"
"| Shell       | N/A                                                       |\n"
"| Forbidden   | Glow-as-brand; multi-layer shadows for idle chrome        |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:97
#, no-wrap
msgid "Iconography"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:100
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Intent:** Lucide icons; default size aligned with controls (`size-4` common).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:107
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Lens        | Adaptation                                                      |\n"
"| ----------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Invariant   | Icon set and default size                                       |\n"
"| Layout      | N/A                                                             |\n"
"| Interaction | Enlarge **button hit box**, not the global icon size, for touch |\n"
"| Shell       | N/A                                                             |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:108
#, no-wrap
msgid "Motion"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:111
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Intent:** Transitions for open/close and state change (Radix/shadcn animate). Motion clarifies hierarchy; it is not ornament.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:119
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Lens        | Adaptation                                                         |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| Invariant   | Prefer existing animate utilities                                  |\n"
"| Layout      | Sheet slide vs Dialog zoom follows presentation                    |\n"
"| Interaction | Do not depend on hover transitions for essential feedback on touch |\n"
"| Shell       | N/A                                                                |\n"
"| Forbidden   | Meaningless glow pulses                                            |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:120
#, no-wrap
msgid "Focus and keyboard"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:123
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Intent:** Visible `focus-visible` rings (`ring` / `ring-ring`). Dialogs/Sheets default to **blocking** auto-focus on open; confirm actions must not receive default focus.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:131
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Lens        | Adaptation                                                                             |\n"
"| ----------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Invariant   | Focus rings; no stealth focus traps on destructive confirms                            |\n"
"| Layout      | N/A                                                                                    |\n"
"| Interaction | Keyboard users need visible focus; Enter-to-send is interaction capability, not layout |\n"
"| Shell       | External keyboard does not flip touch→pointer strategy                                 |\n"
"| Forbidden   | `autoFocus` on destructive confirm buttons                                             |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:132
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disabled and opacity"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:135
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Intent:** `disabled:opacity-50` + `pointer-events-none` on controls; completed/softened content may use `opacity-60`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:140
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Lens                         | Adaptation                  |\n"
"| ---------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n"
"| Invariant                    | Disabled affordance pattern |\n"
"| Layout / Interaction / Shell | N/A                         |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:141
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scrollbars and safe area"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:144
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Intent:** Global thin scrollbar styles (`ui-kit` scrollbar CSS). Safe-area CSS variables for notched devices; layout chrome clears bottom nav height.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:152
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Lens        | Adaptation                                                                                                                                 |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| Invariant   | Shared scrollbar look                                                                                                                      |\n"
"| Layout      | Compact fixed layers respect `--app-bottom-nav-h`                                                                                          |\n"
"| Interaction | Pull-to-refresh ignores starts near left edge (drawer conflict) — see [patterns](patterns.md) / [page refresh](../aspects/page-refresh.md) |\n"
"| Shell       | Safe-area and keyboard inset host differences                                                                                              |\n"
"| Forbidden   | Theme colors inside safe-area-only CSS files                                                                                               |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:153
#, no-wrap
msgid "z-index"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:156
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Intent:** Stable stacking for menus, sheets, toasts. Prefer shared conventions over magic numbers.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/foundations.md:164
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Lens        | Adaptation                                                                 |\n"
"| ----------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Invariant   | Overlay above chrome; do not cover bottom nav by raising z-index           |\n"
"| Layout      | Sheet/Dialog/Drawer stacking                                               |\n"
"| Interaction | Context menu / ActionSheet above content                                   |\n"
"| Shell       | N/A                                                                        |\n"
"| Forbidden   | Ad-hoc `z-[9999]` (**pending alignment** where present, e.g. some pickers) |\n"
msgstr ""
